
@startuml
title COLORS Web Application - Use Case Diagram

left to right direction

actor "User" as User

rectangle "COLORS Web Application" {

    usecase "Log In" as Login
    usecase "Validate Credentials" as Validate
    usecase "Access Color Page" as Access
    usecase "Add Color" as Add
    usecase "Search Colors" as Search
    usecase "View Search Results" as Results
    usecase "Log Out" as Logout
    usecase "Maintain Login Session" as Session
}

User --> Login
User --> Add
User --> Search
User --> Results
User --> Logout

Login ..> Validate : Validate
Login ..> Session : Session
Login ..> Access : Access

Search ..> Results : Results

note right of Add
  A color is associated
  with the user's ID.
end note

note right of Search
  Supports partial color
  name matching.
  Results are user-specific.
end note

note bottom of Session
  Login information is stored
  in a browser cookie.
  Cookie expiration: 20 minutes.
end note

@enduml
